{
 "sheet": 1,
 "name": "GT-USB-7051A",
 "kind": "connector",
 "manufacturer": "G-Switch",
 "title": "GT-USB-7051A: USB Type-C receptacle, 16 contacts, vertical, surface mount, 10.50 mm tall",
 "source": {
  "revision": "Rev A1, 2024-12-06",
  "pages": 1
 },
 "summary": "A female USB Type-C socket that stands upright on the board, its opening facing away from the PCB at 10.50 mm height. It carries 16 of the 24 Type-C positions (power, ground, CC, USB 2.0 data and SBU) on two rows of surface-mount tails at 0.79 mm pitch, with a stainless-steel shell held by four through-hole legs and two locating posts. VBUS contacts are rated 5 A, VCONN 1.25 A and the rest 0.25 A; operating range is -40 °C to +85 °C and life is 10,000 mating cycles.",
