 "operation": [
  {
   "topic": "Mating order",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "GND and VBUS contacts mate first; CC, D+, D- and SBU contacts mate second."
  },
  {
   "topic": "Mounting",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "The socket stands upright on the board with its opening facing up. The 16 contact tails are surface-mount pads in two rows; the four shell legs go into plated holes. Two Ø0.55 posts on the body, 7.50 apart, match a Ø0.65 round hole and a 1.00 × 0.65 slot 7.50 apart in the land pattern."
  }
 ],
